# Basename suffix or full path. Dock / WallpaperAgent break the desktop.
# loginwindow is injected on purpose (TransparentPictures); SquareCorners
# blacklists it. Safe mode is a separate check in infect/ammonia.
Dock
WallpaperAgent
WallpaperAerialsExtension
WindowServer
